# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Repository-level ignores
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# There was no root .gitignore at all, which is part of why the release
# state drifted so far: 200MB of archives and a source tarball sat
# alongside the code with nothing distinguishing them from it, while the
# entire Round 8 cart module, the Round 9 inventory module and 8 of the
# 14 migrations were untracked and invisible.

# ── Dependencies ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/

# ── Build output ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
.next/
dist/
build/
out/
*.tsbuildinfo

# ── Secrets ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Belt and braces: backend/.gitignore already ignores .env, and this
# makes it true for every directory rather than one.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ── Archives and vendored installers ──────────────────────────────
# Never part of a release. The ones that were tracked (awscliv2.zip at
# 70MB, plus dist/src/stores snapshots from May–June 2026 long
# superseded by the working tree) are untracked by this change; the
# files themselves are left on disk rather than deleted.
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.7z

# ── Database dumps and backups ────────────────────────────────────
# A production dump in a repository is a data-protection incident
# waiting for someone to clone it.
*.dump
neon-backup*.sql
backup.sql

# ── Local logs and OS noise ───────────────────────────────────────
*.log
.DS_Store

# ── Large browser-evidence captures ───────────────────────────────
# 14MB of PNG screenshots from earlier investigation rounds. Evidence,
# not release content.
payment-browser-evidence/

# NOTE, deliberately NOT ignored: the working-note directories
# (01/, 02/, 3/, report/, ي/) that hold the Round 5–10 reports and
# audits. They are left UNTRACKED and VISIBLE in `git status` rather
# than hidden, so that whoever commits this decides consciously whether
# project history belongs in the repository. Hiding them would repeat
# the mistake this file exists to fix.
